{"id":"vod_sn_37137","vodId":"37137","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"男子游泳部第二季","name_cn":"男子游泳部第二季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/876026f7a207b48ee77caad733ca8fa1.jpg"},"summary":"炎热的夏天又到了，观众们则迎来了活力四射、清凉十足的运动番《Free!》第二季！五位游泳部的伙伴，再次带着分外瞩目的肌肉线条，展开了关于游泳和友情的青春故事。　　在第二季中，主人公七濑遥（岛崎信长 配音）以及好朋友橘真琴（铃木达央 配音）成为岩鸢高中三年级生，他们一方面烦恼着没有新人加入游泳部，另一方面还面临着毕业去向问题。同为游泳部成员的渚（代永翼 配音）和怜（平川大辅 配音），积极准备着全国大赛的训练。　　与第一季相比，本季最大的看点，就是新角色山崎宗介（细谷佳正 配音）的登场。他是凛（宫野真守 配音）小学时代的好友，游泳实力强劲，转校归来加入了凛的游泳部。两个游泳部，两支接力队伍，在未来的全国赛上，会碰撞出什么样的青春水花？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:49:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CYZiDSUtrg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iREBEmNme61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GzWEskEqXS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Lwh63WdWZ31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y4siUcszx81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q8T5MyjMnE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NFJkm0nRqQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8aXJywdLZB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QrCZ4gSZ9H1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PPZ5F0hfJC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uyDMQ1Edab1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0LQ9Mi1Wb61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UakWVkyKsN1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:14.471Z"}